Assignment 1 Part 1 Downloads
The Git bundle contains the Part 1A and Part 1B repository updates and validation evidence. The 73-second demo shows both applications.

Part 1A human review files
The latest Smart Todo harness passed all six gates with 88 tests and 86.47% coverage. Harness report

harness-log.md — existing log with section 8 ready for your review and links to the evidence.

human-review-v2.json — review form with evidence paths and blank decision fields.

Complete the decision, date, name, and rationale in your own words before adding the files to GitHub.

Part 1B human review files
The final live run passed all 72 samples against the 90% threshold. Passing evaluation report

harness-log.md — fill in your observations and save the completed log as Part-1B/evidence/harness-log.md.

part1b-release-decision-input.json — enter your name, decision, and rationale. Use the same decision and rationale in both files.

From Part-1B, with its virtual environment active, replace the example path with the path to your completed input file and run these commands.

$review = Get-Content -Raw "C:\path\to\part1b-release-decision-input.json" | ConvertFrom-Json
python -m reminder_agent.evaluation.release_decision --snapshot-manifest $review.snapshot_manifest --reviewer $review.reviewer --decision $review.decision --rationale $review.rationale --output $review.output_directory
Commit your completed log and the generated record at Part-1B/evidence/release-decisions/20261121T163047Z-1ca7a017.json.

